                                "sense_id": "f281e6ac-a87d-3769-b108-952f26eba0c1",
                                "text": "Every cat is necessarily such that its parts are arranged catwise."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6280fbcd-5dc5-4864-ba38-31cb69a380c4",
                                "sense_id": "f281e6ac-a87d-3769-b108-952f26eba0c1",
                                "text": "In a happier mood, had he not been driven by hunger, he might have played with it, catwise, when it was dead, tossing it up and pretending that it was alive..."
